<title>NEW ZEALAND: Direct Capital buys back 0.1 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Direct Capital buys back 0.1 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Direct Capital Partners said on Wednesday it had acquired 100,000 of its own securities at 71 cents each as part of its on-market share buyback.</p>
<p>The total number of shares of this class on issue after this allotment is 85,010,000.</p>
<p>Direct Capital now holds 3,763,136 shares in the company or 4.43 percent of the issued capital as treasury stock. --Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
